  94+ 6BD3                  ;
  95+ 6BD3                  ; Porta $DF → riga P, O, I, U, Y.
  96+ 6BD3                  ; Bit 0 = P (destra), Bit 1 = O (sinistra).
  97+ 6BD3
  98+ 6BD3 16 00            ld  d, $00                  ; azzera output
  99+ 6BD5 01 FE DF         ld  bc, $dffe
 100+ 6BD8 ED 78            in  a, (c)                  ; legge riga $FE
