1133+ 8318 E5               push hl
1134+ 8319 D5               push de
1135+ 831A C5               push bc
1136+ 831B DD E5            push ix
1137+ 831D FD E5            push iy
1138+ 831F
1139+ 831F                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------
1140+ 831F                  ; Azzera items_grid (32 x 16 = 512 byte)
1141+ 831F                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------
